      "command": "./build.sh --backend={native|llvm}",
      "contract": "Selects the producer backend: the backend Stage1 uses to generate Stage2 (CMake SULTANC_STAGE2_BACKEND, default native; on Windows the verify stages use it too). The built compiler's own backends come from --enable-llvm; programs choose theirs with the compiler's --backend. No fallback: an unavailable producer backend fails at configure time with the supported path."
    }
