    },
    "methods": {
      "prebuilt": "Download the host's pinned upstream release archive, verify its SHA-256 before use, extract only the declared members, link the monolithic shared libLLVM SultanC's CMake requires from its component archives, keep only the SDK files, verify, and cache. Qualification may do this on a cache miss (minutes).",
      "source": "Fallback when no upstream archive satisfies the contract: build the pinned llvm-project source with the host's pinned compiler, bounded compile/link jobs, and separate checked build and install steps. Only the trusted provisioning workflow does this (hours); qualification requires its cache.",
      "none": "The host needs no LLVM SDK for its declared checks."
